WEBVTT

00:08:58.874 --> 00:09:00.025
(Laughter)

00:09:00.049 --> 00:09:01.485
Here, back foot, back foot.

00:09:02.438 --> 00:09:03.611
OK, up there?

00:09:03.635 --> 00:09:04.944
That was called a 360 flip.

00:09:04.968 --> 00:09:07.701
Notice how the board flipped
and spun this way, both axes.

00:09:09.494 --> 00:09:14.029
And another example
of how the context changed,

00:09:14.053 --> 00:09:18.047
and the creative process
for me and for most skaters,

00:09:18.071 --> 00:09:21.293
is, you go, you get out of the car,
you check for security,

00:09:21.317 --> 00:09:22.474
you check for stuff.

00:09:22.498 --> 00:09:23.693
(Laughter)

00:09:23.717 --> 00:09:26.188
It's funny, you get to know
their rhythms, you know,

00:09:26.212 --> 00:09:27.835
the guys that cruise around --

00:09:27.859 --> 00:09:29.229
(Laughter)

00:09:29.253 --> 00:09:31.348
Skateboarding is such
a humbling thing, man.